<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδᾰτ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.59
			</span></i>, al.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱματώδης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				586a29
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος] ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					364b21
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέφος] -έστερον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				377b6
			</span></i>; of signs of the Zodiac, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				6.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. κρύσταλλος,</span> of melting
			ice, <i>wet, sloppy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.23
			</span></i>; of taste, <i>watery, insipid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.10.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>full</i>
			
			<i>of water,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.19.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαιρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.7.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dropsical,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.7.4
			</span></i>.</div>
